# Clean builds

Cheapest reset first. Stop at the first one that fixes the problem. Each says
what it deletes, so nothing precious is lost by surprise.

| # | Symptom | Reset | Deletes |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | A task replays a stale result | `{{CLEAR_TASK_CACHE}}` | Task-runner cache only |
| 2 | Odd dependency errors after switching branches | `{{REINSTALL_DEPENDENCIES}}` | Installed dependencies |
| 3 | A bundler or dev server shows old code | `{{CLEAR_BUNDLER_CACHE}}` | Bundler/transform cache |
| 4 | Native or compiled build misbehaves | `{{CLEAN_NATIVE_BUILD}}` | Build output directories |
| 5 | Local data is wrong or migrations are tangled | `{{RESET_LOCAL_STACK}}` | Local service containers and their data |
| 6 | Nothing else worked | `{{FULL_CLEAN}}` | Everything ignored by git except local env and keys |

Never reset shared, staging or production data from this list.
